# tds-shared — local dev environment
#
# This package has no runtime config. The only env var that matters is
# NPM_TOKEN, which the publish workflow uses to push to GitHub Packages
# and which consumers (tds-landingpage, tds-blog, tds-admin, tds-customer)
# need set in their shell to install this package.
#
# Set NPM_TOKEN in your shell (not in this file — npm doesn't auto-load .env):
#
# PowerShell:
#   $env:NPM_TOKEN = "ghp_…"        # classic PAT, scope: read:packages
# bash / zsh:
#   export NPM_TOKEN=ghp_…
#
# The token must be a classic PAT (not fine-grained) with `read:packages`
# on the Tracht-Digital-Solutions org. Publishing additionally needs
# `write:packages`.
